      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "description",
          "text": "HBase stackgraph is a Java application; libblkid1 block device library not called by JVM. This statement concerns SUSE-SU-2026:2485-1 in pkg:rpm/suse/libblkid1 as a subcomponent of pkg:oci/stackgraph-hbase?repository_url=registry.rancher.com/suse-observability/stackgraph-hbase. It does not assert the status of pkg:rpm/suse/libblkid1 when used independently or in other products."
        },
        {
          "category": "description",
          "text": "StackGraph HBase (Java) does not link against libfdisk1; fdisk library not in JVM execute path. This statement concerns SUSE-SU-2026:2485-1 in pkg:rpm/suse/libfdisk1 as a subcomponent of pkg:oci/stackgraph-hbase?repository_url=registry.rancher.com/suse-observability/stackgraph-hbase. It does not assert the status of pkg:rpm/suse/libfdisk1 when used independently or in other products."
        },
        {
          "category": "description",
          "text": "StackGraph HBase (Java) does not link against libsmartcols1; column-format library not in JVM path. This statement concerns SUSE-SU-2026:2485-1 in pkg:rpm/suse/libsmartcols1 as a subcomponent of pkg:oci/stackgraph-hbase?repository_url=registry.rancher.com/suse-observability/stackgraph-hbase. It does not assert the status of pkg:rpm/suse/libsmartcols1 when used independently or in other products."
        },
        {
          "category": "description",
          "text": "Java HBase app uses java.util.UUID; C libuuid1 library not loaded by the JVM. This statement concerns SUSE-SU-2026:2485-1 in pkg:rpm/suse/libuuid1 as a subcomponent of pkg:oci/stackgraph-hbase?repository_url=registry.rancher.com/suse-observability/stackgraph-hbase. It does not assert the status of pkg:rpm/suse/libuuid1 when used independently or in other products."
        }
      ],
